### MaterialLots — GET ALL, active only, with plant, material and stock (expects 200 OK)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots
Accept: application/json

### MaterialLots — GET ALL filtered by plant and material (expects 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots?plantId=1&materialId=1
Accept: application/json
